请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-05-agenda-003

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
弄个议程提醒,倒计时数字会变,点一下进系统,日程从日历读,快开始提醒我

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "弄个议程提醒,倒计时数字会变,点一下进系统,日程从日历读,快开始提醒我",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToIntent",
      "args": {
        "intentName": "ViewCalendarEvent",
        "params": {
          "entityId": "{{ ${/data/calendar/items/0/entityId} }}"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "data": {
      "calendar": {
        "items": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "从本地日历读取的近期日程列表，卡片展示第一条即将开始的日程。",
          "sampleValue": [
            {
              "entityId": "calendar-event-1001",
              "title": "产品评审",
              "dtStart": "14:30",
              "dtEnd": "15:00",
              "eventLocation": "3号会议室",
              "remindTime": [
                "提前10分钟"
              ],
              "countdownText": "12",
              "countdownUnit": "分钟",
              "statusText": "快开始"
            }
          ],
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "单条日程项。",
            "sampleValue": {
